{"persona": {"her": "米雪衣，消息灵通、转述不走心、嘴快心热，底线：不占邻居便宜、被纠错认账但不许摆脸色", "me": "兰台生，做财务、对数字敏感、嫌她马虎但从不拒", "relationship_stage": "邻里熟人（同栋半年的对账搭子）"}, "initial_kb": {"me": "兰台生做财务，住澜庭小区5栋2单元7楼。11月8日路过公告栏拍过供暖费通知：每平米26.5元，11月20日前缴清，逾期按日千分之三收滞纳金。自家供暖费11月12日已线上缴清，回执短信保留。楼栋长老闵在群里说过充电桩增容，原话是先摸底各家意见，不牵头去谈。", "her": "米雪衣住澜庭小区5栋2单元12楼，开网店卖家居小物，消息灵通但爱转二手话，口算常出错，和兰台生因互相代收快递认识半年。", "warmth": "邻里半年，互相代收过快递带过饭，她有事爱第一个找他核数，他嫌她马虎但从不拒。", "style": "她说话快，一段消息塞三件事；他对数字敏感，习惯给依据。", "lessons": "数字先给来源再给结论；转述的话标注转述人；纠正她之前先接住她的急。"}, "plans": [], "assets_root": "D:\\lovebrain-arena\\candidates\\action_policy_r9_slim\\assets", "events": [{"uid": 0, "role": "HER", "text": "兰台生，物业群里说今年供暖费每平米26块，我记忆里一直是24，是不是偷偷涨了？你要是路过公告栏帮我拍张照，我家门口那张被雨泡花了，字全糊。", "ts": "2026-11-10 19:35"}, {"uid": 1, "role": "HER", "text": "3栋的小蓟说，26块5是含基础热费的，另外每平米还要收三块钱计量费，今年新加的。不过她自己也是听她们楼栋长说的，楼栋长又听谁说的不知道，反正传到我这是第三手了。", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:10"}, {"uid": 2, "role": "HER", "text": "物业公众号中午推了正式通知，我截图了：单价26.5，含基础热费，计量费今年停收，11月20号前缴清，逾期一天按千分之三收滞纳金。小蓟那个三块钱计量费，看来是老黄历。", "ts": "2026-11-13 12:30"}, {"uid": 3, "role": "HER", "text": "我家建筑面积94.6，按26.5一平算是2567对吧？我口算的，你帮我核一下，数学不好，别笑话我。", "ts": "2026-11-14 15:20"}, {"uid": 4, "role": "HER", "text": "算了不口算了，等缴费通道开了我按计算器。对了，收费窗口的郑荇跟我说，20号之后缴也没事，每年都有晚缴的，没听说谁真被收了滞纳金。她天天坐窗口，总比公告准吧？", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:05"}, {"uid": 5, "role": "HER", "text": "充电桩增容的事你听说了吧？老闵说他就牵头去跟供电局谈，每户先按380估。你什么态度？就差咱们栋没表态了，别让老闵觉得咱们事多。", "ts": "2026-11-17 20:30"}, {"uid": 6, "role": "HER", "text": "老闵嫌咱们栋回得慢，让我来问第二遍。另外380是最终价对吧？我记得群里就是这么说的。你到底什么态度，给个痛快话。", "ts": "2026-11-18 09:15"}, {"uid": 7, "role": "HER", "text": "业委会公示栏贴出来了，最终价368一户，比我嘴上的380便宜12块。行，我估错了方向，白紧张一场。老闵也把话认领了：他说的是牵头摸底，不是牵头谈。算我耳朵抓字抓一半。", "ts": "2026-11-19 21:40"}, {"uid": 8, "role": "HER", "text": "最后一天，你缴费了没？还有个事：我们这层楼道灯坏了，物业说材料人工一共640，这层6户分摊。我刚才跟人说是128，说完发现不对，640除以6除不尽啊？一人到底多少，这怎么算？", "ts": "2026-11-20 19:05"}, {"uid": 9, "role": "HER", "text": "供电检修那条通知我翻不到了，群里转发的写的是周日停，公告栏版本我记不清。我这周末要烤东西，烤箱功率大，得错开停电那天。你家收到短信没？写的哪天？", "ts": "2026-11-20 21:30"}, {"uid": 10, "role": "HER", "text": "今天停电你们楼也停了？小蓟说她家没停，还说她听郑荇提过，真收过一户滞纳金，上个月的事，谁家她不肯说。这消息我不知道真假，你缴费那天回执怎么写的，滞纳金那栏有吗？", "ts": "2026-11-21 18:20"}, {"uid": 11, "role": "HER", "text": "我今晚缴完了，回执2506.9，一分不多一分不少，多亏有人当年数学及格。以后公告栏你拍我也拍，咱俩成立对账小组，会费就从楼道灯那笔摊不清的钱里出。睡了，晚安。", "ts": "2026-11-22 21:50"}], "uid_by_key": {"HER|兰台生，物业群里说今年供暖费每平米26块，我记忆里一直是24，是不是偷偷涨了？你要是路过公告栏帮我拍张照，我家门口那张被雨泡花了，字全糊。|2026-11-10 19:35": 0, "HER|3栋的小蓟说，26块5是含基础热费的，另外每平米还要收三块钱计量费，今年新加的。不过她自己也是听她们楼栋长说的，楼栋长又听谁说的不知道，反正传到我这是第三手了。|2026-11-11 21:10": 1, "HER|物业公众号中午推了正式通知，我截图了：单价26.5，含基础热费，计量费今年停收，11月20号前缴清，逾期一天按千分之三收滞纳金。小蓟那个三块钱计量费，看来是老黄历。|2026-11-13 12:30": 2, "HER|我家建筑面积94.6，按26.5一平算是2567对吧？我口算的，你帮我核一下，数学不好，别笑话我。|2026-11-14 15:20": 3, "HER|算了不口算了，等缴费通道开了我按计算器。对了，收费窗口的郑荇跟我说，20号之后缴也没事，每年都有晚缴的，没听说谁真被收了滞纳金。她天天坐窗口，总比公告准吧？|2026-11-15 21:05": 4, "HER|充电桩增容的事你听说了吧？老闵说他就牵头去跟供电局谈，每户先按380估。你什么态度？就差咱们栋没表态了，别让老闵觉得咱们事多。|2026-11-17 20:30": 5, "HER|老闵嫌咱们栋回得慢，让我来问第二遍。另外380是最终价对吧？我记得群里就是这么说的。你到底什么态度，给个痛快话。|2026-11-18 09:15": 6, "HER|业委会公示栏贴出来了，最终价368一户，比我嘴上的380便宜12块。行，我估错了方向，白紧张一场。老闵也把话认领了：他说的是牵头摸底，不是牵头谈。算我耳朵抓字抓一半。|2026-11-19 21:40": 7, "HER|最后一天，你缴费了没？还有个事：我们这层楼道灯坏了，物业说材料人工一共640，这层6户分摊。我刚才跟人说是128，说完发现不对，640除以6除不尽啊？一人到底多少，这怎么算？|2026-11-20 19:05": 8, "HER|供电检修那条通知我翻不到了，群里转发的写的是周日停，公告栏版本我记不清。我这周末要烤东西，烤箱功率大，得错开停电那天。你家收到短信没？写的哪天？|2026-11-20 21:30": 9, "HER|今天停电你们楼也停了？小蓟说她家没停，还说她听郑荇提过，真收过一户滞纳金，上个月的事，谁家她不肯说。这消息我不知道真假，你缴费那天回执怎么写的，滞纳金那栏有吗？|2026-11-21 18:20": 10, "HER|我今晚缴完了，回执2506.9，一分不多一分不少，多亏有人当年数学及格。以后公告栏你拍我也拍，咱俩成立对账小组，会费就从楼道灯那笔摊不清的钱里出。睡了，晚安。|2026-11-22 21:50": 11}, "uid_seq": 12, "turn_count": 12, "goal_history": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-10 19:42", "status": "explicit", "text": "把公告栏的实际单价和依据告诉她", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-11 21:18", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-17 20:37", "status": "explicit", "text": "纠正牵头的说法，把老闵原话和她的转述分开", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-18 09:22", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-20 19:12", "status": "explicit", "text": "帮她算清分摊，口径不清就说明卡在哪", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-20 21:37", "status": "NONE", "text": "", "effective": false, "adjusted": false, "closed": false}], "action_log": [{"turn": 1, "clock": "2026-11-10 19:42", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 3, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 2, "clock": "2026-11-11 21:18", "signal_hint": "含糊", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 1}, {"turn": 3, "clock": "2026-11-13 12:38", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 3}, {"turn": 4, "clock": "2026-11-14 15:27", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 5, "clock": "2026-11-15 21:12", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 6, "clock": "2026-11-17 20:37", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 7, "clock": "2026-11-18 09:22", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 8, "clock": "2026-11-19 21:47", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "观察", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 3}, {"turn": 9, "clock": "2026-11-20 19:12", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "explicit", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 10, "clock": "2026-11-20 21:37", "signal_hint": "中性", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 11, "clock": "2026-11-21 18:27", "signal_hint": "含糊", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "无目标", "action": "承接", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "小选择", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 2, "updates_applied": 0}, {"turn": 12, "clock": "2026-11-22 21:57", "signal_hint": "收尾", "goal_effective": false, "goal_status": "NONE", "goal_category": "收线", "action": "收尾", "action_allowed": true, "anchor": "m0", "anchor_valid": true, "hook_kind": "未展开角度", "hook_delivered": true, "facts_added": 1, "updates_applied": 0}], "memory_off": false, "flags": {"action_layer": true, "evidence_memory": true}, "mem": {"facts": {"f_0001": {"fact_id": "f_0001", "text": "兰台生做财务，住澜庭小区5栋2单元7楼。11月8日路过公告栏拍过供暖费通知：每平米26.5元，11月20日前缴清，逾期按日千分之三收滞纳金。自家供暖费11月12日已线上缴清，回执短信保留。楼栋长老闵在群里说过充电桩增容，原话是先摸底各家意见，不牵头去谈。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0002": {"fact_id": "f_0002", "text": "米雪衣住澜庭小区5栋2单元12楼，开网店卖家居小物，消息灵通但爱转二手话，口算常出错，和兰台生因互相代收快递认识半年。", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0003": {"fact_id": "f_0003", "text": "邻里半年，互相代收过快递带过饭，她有事爱第一个找他核数，他嫌她马虎但从不拒。", "subject": "SHARED", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:warmth", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0004": {"fact_id": "f_0004", "text": "她说话快，一段消息塞三件事；他对数字敏感，习惯给依据。", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "kbin:style", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0005": {"fact_id": "f_0005", "text": "兰台生，做财务、对数字敏感、嫌她马虎但从不拒", "subject": "ME", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:me", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0006": {"fact_id": "f_0006", "text": "米雪衣，消息灵通、转述不走心、嘴快心热，底线：不占邻居便宜、被纠错认账但不许摆脸色", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [], "evidence_quotes": [], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed_seed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "persona:her", "plan_status": "", "ts": "", "history": []}, "f_0007": {"fact_id": "f_0007", "text": "她说小蓟转述：供暖费每平米26.5元含基础热费，另加每平米3元计量费（第三手转述，源头不明）", "subject": "HER", "relation": "转述物业群", "evidence_uids": [0, 1, 2], "evidence_quotes": ["物业群里说今年供暖费每平米26块", "26块5是含基础热费的，另外每平米还要收三块钱计量费，今年新加的。", "计量费今年停收"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "cancelled", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 21:18", "valid_to": "2026-11-13 12:38", "supersedes": "f_0007@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 19:42", "history": [{"status": "confirmed", "text": "她说物业群里说今年供暖费每平米26块", "valid_to": "2026-11-11 21:18", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [1], "quote": "26块5是含基础热费的，另外每平米还要收三块钱计量费，今年新加的。"}, {"status": "confirmed", "text": "她说小蓟转述：供暖费每平米26.5元含基础热费，另加每平米3元计量费（第三手转述，源头不明）", "valid_to": "2026-11-13 12:38", "reason": "cancel", "src_uids": [2], "quote": "计量费今年停收"}]}, "f_0008": {"fact_id": "f_0008", "text": "她记忆里供暖费一直是24元/平米", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["我记忆里一直是24"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 19:42", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 19:42", "history": []}, "f_0009": {"fact_id": "f_0009", "text": "她家门口的供暖费通知被雨泡花、字全糊", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [0], "evidence_quotes": ["我家门口那张被雨泡花了，字全糊"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 19:42", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 19:42", "history": []}, "f_0010": {"fact_id": "f_0010", "text": "她请我路过公告栏时帮她拍张通知照片", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [0, 2], "evidence_quotes": ["你要是路过公告栏帮我拍张照", "我截图了"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "cancelled", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-10 19:42", "valid_to": "2026-11-13 12:38", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-10 19:42", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "她请我路过公告栏时帮她拍张通知照片", "valid_to": "2026-11-13 12:38", "reason": "cancel", "src_uids": [2], "quote": "我截图了"}]}, "f_0011": {"fact_id": "f_0011", "text": "她说小蓟转述：26块5含基础热费，另每平米加收3元计量费，今年新加", "subject": "HER", "relation": "供暖费传闻（第三手转述）", "evidence_uids": [1, 2], "evidence_quotes": ["26块5是含基础热费的，另外每平米还要收三块钱计量费，今年新加的。", "计量费今年停收"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "cancelled", "event_time": "2026年供暖季", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 21:18", "valid_to": "2026-11-13 12:38", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:18", "history": [{"status": "tentative", "text": "她说小蓟转述：26块5含基础热费，另每平米加收3元计量费，今年新加", "valid_to": "2026-11-13 12:38", "reason": "cancel", "src_uids": [2], "quote": "计量费今年停收"}]}, "f_0012": {"fact_id": "f_0012", "text": "她说明这条消息到她这里已是第三手，源头不明", "subject": "HER", "relation": "信息来源", "evidence_uids": [1], "evidence_quotes": ["反正传到我这是第三手了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-11 21:18", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:18", "history": []}, "f_0013": {"fact_id": "f_0013", "text": "物业公众号正式通知：单价26.5元含基础热费，计量费今年停收，11月20日前缴清，逾期一天按千分之三收滞纳金", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "供暖费通知", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["单价26.5，含基础热费，计量费今年停收，11月20号前缴清，逾期一天按千分之三收滞纳金"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-13 12:30", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 12:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 12:38", "history": []}, "f_0014": {"fact_id": "f_0014", "text": "她已截图物业公众号的正式通知", "subject": "HER", "relation": "通知留存", "evidence_uids": [2], "evidence_quotes": ["我截图了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-13 12:30", "valid_from": "2026-11-13 12:38", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-13 12:38", "history": []}, "f_0015": {"fact_id": "f_0015", "text": "她家建筑面积94.6平", "subject": "HER", "relation": "住房信息", "evidence_uids": [3], "evidence_quotes": ["我家建筑面积94.6"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-14 15:27", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-14 15:27", "history": []}, "f_0016": {"fact_id": "f_0016", "text": "她说等缴费通道开了再按计算器算", "subject": "HER", "relation": "缴费安排", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["算了不口算了，等缴费通道开了我按计算器。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 21:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:12", "history": []}, "f_0017": {"fact_id": "f_0017", "text": "她转述收费窗口郑荇的话：20号之后缴也没事，没听说谁真被收滞纳金", "subject": "HER", "relation": "转述郑荇说法", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["收费窗口的郑荇跟我说，20号之后缴也没事，每年都有晚缴的，没听说谁真被收了滞纳金"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "tentative", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 21:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:12", "history": []}, "f_0018": {"fact_id": "f_0018", "text": "她打算等缴费通道开了再按计算器缴", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [4], "evidence_quotes": ["等缴费通道开了我按计算器"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-15 21:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-15 21:12", "history": []}, "f_0019": {"fact_id": "f_0019", "text": "老闵称自己只是牵头摸底，不是牵头去跟供电局谈", "subject": "HER", "relation": "转述老闵的话", "evidence_uids": [5, 7], "evidence_quotes": ["老闵说他就牵头去跟供电局谈，每户先按380估", "他说的是牵头摸底，不是牵头谈"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 21:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0019@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 20:37", "history": [{"status": "tentative", "text": "她转述老闵将牵头去跟供电局谈，每户先按380估", "valid_to": "2026-11-19 21:47", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [7], "quote": "他说的是牵头摸底，不是牵头谈"}]}, "f_0020": {"fact_id": "f_0020", "text": "她说就差咱们栋没表态", "subject": "HER", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [5], "evidence_quotes": ["就差咱们栋没表态了"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-17 20:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 20:37", "history": []}, "f_0021": {"fact_id": "f_0021", "text": "每户368元（最终价，公示栏已出）", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [5, 7], "evidence_quotes": ["每户先按380估", "最终价368一户"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 21:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0021@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-17 20:37", "history": [{"status": "proposed", "text": "每户先按380估（估算，未敲定）", "valid_to": "2026-11-19 21:47", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [7], "quote": "最终价368一户"}]}, "f_0022": {"fact_id": "f_0022", "text": "老闵嫌咱们栋回得慢，让她来问第二遍", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "转述", "evidence_uids": [6], "evidence_quotes": ["老闵嫌咱们栋回得慢，让我来问第二遍。"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-18 09:15", "valid_from": "2026-11-18 09:22", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 09:22", "history": []}, "f_0023": {"fact_id": "f_0023", "text": "充电桩增容最终价368元一户，业委会公示栏已贴出", "subject": "HER", "relation": "转述/认知", "evidence_uids": [6, 7], "evidence_quotes": ["另外380是最终价对吧？我记得群里就是这么说的。", "最终价368一户，比我嘴上的380便宜12块"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 21:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "f_0023@v1", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-18 09:22", "history": [{"status": "tentative", "text": "她认为380是最终价，说群里就是这么讲的", "valid_to": "2026-11-19 21:47", "reason": "correct", "src_uids": [7], "quote": "最终价368一户，比我嘴上的380便宜12块"}]}, "f_0024": {"fact_id": "f_0024", "text": "业委会公示栏贴出充电桩增容最终价每户368元", "subject": "PUBLIC", "relation": "公示价格", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["最终价368一户"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 21:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 21:47", "history": []}, "f_0025": {"fact_id": "f_0025", "text": "老闵称自己是牵头摸底，不是牵头去谈", "subject": "THIRD", "relation": "楼栋长表态", "evidence_uids": [7], "evidence_quotes": ["他说的是牵头摸底，不是牵头谈"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-19", "valid_from": "2026-11-19 21:47", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-19 21:47", "history": []}, "f_0026": {"fact_id": "f_0026", "text": "楼道灯维修材料人工共640元，本层6户分摊", "subject": "HER", "relation": "楼道灯维修费", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["我们这层楼道灯坏了，物业说材料人工一共640，这层6户分摊"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-20", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 19:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 19:12", "history": []}, "f_0027": {"fact_id": "f_0027", "text": "她先前跟人报的分摊数是128元，自己发现不对", "subject": "HER", "relation": "分摊口算", "evidence_uids": [8], "evidence_quotes": ["我刚才跟人说是128，说完发现不对"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-20", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 19:12", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 19:12", "history": []}, "f_0028": {"fact_id": "f_0028", "text": "她这周末要烤东西，烤箱功率大，得错开停电那天", "subject": "HER", "relation": "周末安排", "evidence_uids": [9], "evidence_quotes": ["我这周末要烤东西，烤箱功率大，得错开停电那天"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-21/22 周末", "valid_from": "2026-11-20 21:37", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-20 21:37", "history": []}, "f_0029": {"fact_id": "f_0029", "text": "小蓟说她家没停电", "subject": "HER", "relation": "转述", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["小蓟说她家没停"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "tentative", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 18:27", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 18:27", "history": []}, "f_0030": {"fact_id": "f_0030", "text": "她听郑荇提过真收过一户滞纳金，上个月的事，谁家不肯说", "subject": "HER", "relation": "转述", "evidence_uids": [10], "evidence_quotes": ["她听郑荇提过，真收过一户滞纳金，上个月的事，谁家她不肯说"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "tentative", "event_time": "上个月", "valid_from": "2026-11-21 18:27", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-21 18:27", "history": []}, "f_0031": {"fact_id": "f_0031", "text": "她今晚缴完供暖费，回执2506.9", "subject": "HER", "relation": "供暖费缴纳", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["我今晚缴完了，回执2506.9"], "certainty": "confirmed", "status": "confirmed", "event_time": "2026-11-22 晚", "valid_from": "2026-11-22 21:57", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-22 21:57", "history": []}, "f_0032": {"fact_id": "f_0032", "text": "她提议两人成立对账小组，会费从楼道灯那笔钱里出（玩笑提议，未敲定）", "subject": "UNKNOWN", "relation": "", "evidence_uids": [11], "evidence_quotes": ["咱俩成立对账小组，会费就从楼道灯那笔摊不清的钱里出"], "certainty": "tentative", "status": "proposed", "event_time": "", "valid_from": "2026-11-22 21:57", "valid_to": "", "supersedes": "", "origin": "reported", "plan_status": "", "ts": "2026-11-22 21:57", "history": []}}, "fact_seq": 32, "updates": [{"fact_id": "f_0007", "action": "correct", "text": "她说小蓟转述：供暖费每平米26.5元含基础热费，另加每平米3元计量费（第三手转述，源头不明）", "old_text": "她说物业群里说今年供暖费每平米26块", "ts": "2026-11-11 21:18", "src_uids"